**Active** — done once, for #4471 ([#4471 split](/kb/incidents/4471-split)); as a standing rule it is
[decision 0002](/kb/decisions/0002-split-by-cause), **proposed**, waiting for Rune (product) and the desk.

How: place every report by what its body says (`#lib/kb/symptoms`), then one ticket per problem.
It changes how [merge by subject](/kb/tasks/dedupe-by-subject) ends, not how it starts.
